---
const { vertical } = Astro.props;
---
<section id="proof">
  <div class="sec-head">
    <div class="sec-tag reveal">Proof</div>
    <h2 class="sec-title reveal" style="transition-delay:.06s">What it looked like for a practice like yours.</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="placeholder reveal" data-placeholder>
      <div class="ph-tag">Placeholder — not for launch</div>
      <p class="ph-body">
        One named {vertical} case study goes here: the practice, what was drowning them,
        what we built, and what changed. Long version lives on <b>/proof</b>.
      </p>
      <p class="ph-note">
        Blocked on case-study rights (BLK-W07). Anonymous is acceptable in the interim —
        “a 14-attorney firm in Salt Lake” beats an empty section. Launch gate #11.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
